%% 10-mastery.mgp - learn MagicPoint on gucOS, deck 10 of 10 (todos/0202).
%% The preamble machinery in depth (%default/%tab/%deffont/%nodefault/
%% %include), what this port deliberately leaves out, and deck craft.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "#102040", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "SpringGreen" 50, left
%tab 2 size 3, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "gold" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Mastery

deck 10 of 10: templates and taste
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%default - the page template

%size 4, fore "white", left
this deck's own preamble:

%size 3, fore "gray70", prefix "   "
default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "#102040"
default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30

%size 4, fore "white"
line N of EVERY page starts with default N's
directives - that is why every title here lands
the same without restyling each page
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The template idiom

	line 1 is blank: it carries the PAGE setup
		area, base size, colors, font
	line 2 is the title: big, centered
	line 3 onward: the body style
	%nodefault on a page opts out of all of it
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Fonts

	%deffont "name" tfont "file.ttf" - define once
	%font "name" - switch anywhere after
	gucOS seeds ONE face: /usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf
		other tfont files fall back to it
	%tfdir sets where bare filenames are looked up
	%tfont0 is the last-resort face
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

\%include - shared style

%size 4, fore "white", left
keep one house style, include it per deck:

%size 3, fore "gray70", prefix "   "
include "/root/style.mgp"

%size 4, fore "white"
preamble-only, and mgp EXITS if the file is
missing - ship the style with the decks
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Not in this port

	upstream mgp on X11 also had:
		%system / %filter - forked helper programs
		%embed, %anim - inline data, MNG movies
		JPEG and EPS images, Xft/kanji engines
	here they no-op or warn - decks still render
	full upstream reference: /usr/share/mgp/SYNTAX
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Deck craft

	one idea per page, six lines of body, tops
	dark ground, light text, one accent color
	sizes tell the hierarchy: 9 title, 5 body, 3 aside
	build tension with %pause, not decoration
	steal from decks you like - they are just text
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Where to go next

	worked examples, one feature each:
		/usr/share/mgp - text, colors, align,
		bullets, images, backgrounds, effects
	right-click ANY deck, Edit, and read it
	then write your own - and present it
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 6, center
go make something worth projecting
%size 3, fore "gray70", center

(q quits - thanks for reading all ten)
